                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.5045/244: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-10-28T17:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 28,
                                1925—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received October 28—7:48
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>467. My 446, October 16, 6 p.m. Following from Justice Johnson: “Court has
                    finished inquiry and I will make report in 6 to 10 days.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
